{"id":"45b2667e9197c2dd","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-caratheodory.md","title":"Carathéodory Extension","display":"thm-caratheodory — Carathéodory Extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-caratheodory","aliases":["58-thm-caratheodory"],"display":"thm-caratheodory — Carathéodory Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure10-algebra-of-sets.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure11-premeasure-on-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-caratheodory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-caratheodory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-caratheodory — Carathéodory Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c1a035d3f86ce767\" href=\"?note=c1a035d3f86ce767\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure10-algebra-of-sets.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure10-algebra-of-sets.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d88df3cf9f12d21e\" href=\"?note=d88df3cf9f12d21e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure11-premeasure-on-algebra\">58-df-zfc-measure11-premeasure-on-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> (algebra of subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c1a035d3f86ce767\" href=\"?note=c1a035d3f86ce767\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure10-algebra-of-sets.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure10-algebra-of-sets.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_0\">\\(\\mu_0\\)</span> (premeasure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d88df3cf9f12d21e\" href=\"?note=d88df3cf9f12d21e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure11-premeasure-on-algebra\">58-df-zfc-measure11-premeasure-on-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\sigma(\\mathcal A)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11PremeasureOnAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11PremeasureOnAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (premeasure predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}caratheodory}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11PremeasureOnAlgebra}_S(\\mu_0,\\mathcal A,X)\\land\\exists F\\in\\mathcal A^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mu_0(F(n))&lt;\\infty)\\Bigr)\\to\\exists!\\mu\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\sigma(\\mathcal A))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(\\mu(A)=\\mu_0(A))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}caratheodory}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11PremeasureOnAlgebra}_S(\\mu_0,\\mathcal A,X)\\land\\exists F\\in\\mathcal A^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mu_0(F(n))&lt;\\infty)\\Bigr)\\to\\exists!\\mu\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\sigma(\\mathcal A))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(\\mu(A)=\\mu_0(A))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A premeasure extends to the generated <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-finiteness supplies uniqueness.</li>\n<li>Completeness is not asserted for the restriction to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\sigma(\\mathcal A)\\)</span>; it is obtained by passing to the completed measure space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure10-algebra-of-sets.md","status":"resolved","id":"c1a035d3f86ce767","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure10-algebra-of-sets.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure11-premeasure-on-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"d88df3cf9f12d21e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure11-premeasure-on-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure10-algebra-of-sets.md","status":"resolved","id":"c1a035d3f86ce767","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal A$ (algebra of subsets of $X$, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure10-algebra-of-sets.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure11-premeasure-on-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"d88df3cf9f12d21e","anchor":"ref-5","tar